<description>&lt;p&gt;The Houthis have renewed missile and drone strikes on Saudi Arabia, hitting a pumping station on the East-West oil pipeline and the Saudi East-West pipeline itself, while Saudi forces report intercepting missiles and drones with debris falling near Mecca, which the Houthis deny targeting. The group also held a mass funeral and called for civilian protection actions. Saudi Arabia is pressuring the EU to label the Houthis as a terrorist organization. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/12/yemens-houthis-renew-strikes-on-saudi-arabia-as-unsc-extends-sanctions?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/11/us-republicans-block-efforts-to-impeach-us-defence-secretary-pete-hegseth-over-iran-war&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/10/world/middleeast/syria-weighs-sending-troops-to-aid-saudi-war-with-houthis.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxPOHNyWUhKaHR2QmJXUjJ6S0xNdDZnZmpKRzJQak9SWVc3cmttUGVfbk13NzBZclpqNnp5N1JFc0JYakw2Wl9hV3BYdm1mMnJQR3BKRFI2Zzh3cVRhTFFxejBSVWtTMkt2WTRGRUxFSkVocF83aFlIOU10Vk11d29TRERPcnFVWHRJYktFOUlGU0x4c0Q0UWVtT3JkUE91ZVNPQ09NTnhaMGxJajZxQnkwWTFvTzN4WnNpMTBYalNZOHFZdnUtX1VHeUVR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxON1pYX0FiYnJXVm4tV0FZcGhMb0V0Z1hGQW9HUF9yNjVfdUFBQ284Uzl6MDNjbXo4MFktbmJYaE51NFV0NzE0REk2dTlNRmR1TzFGbzBZLWtldWRfSkpjZDVGRHg1SUo4ZEk1VlM1dUYyUzZHZHBXZ2NYdnFZU1RuTW40M203Y0ZBdjgwYnVGdnN0QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;